# Lumber stairs, ascending toward +x: three one-twelfth treads carried on
# two sawtooth stringers, open underneath - a carpentered look over the
# same ramp physics as the plain stairs. The stringers rise in twelfth
# steps, which the ramp pass joins into one diagonal per side.
